00:46:25.650 --> 00:46:27.900
highly scalable, use GPUs.

00:46:27.900 --> 00:46:31.510
Now we can see there's
another piece of this

00:46:31.510 --> 00:46:37.600
that is also very common, is
you've got your trained model.

00:46:37.600 --> 00:46:39.160
You want to deploy
it, and then you

00:46:39.160 --> 00:46:41.800
want to use it for prediction.

00:46:41.800 --> 00:46:46.300
So that's sort of the
bottom part of this graph.

00:46:46.300 --> 00:46:50.890
And in the lower left, that's
